1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,808
My shadow just took a step while my feet were completely glued to the cold kitchen floor.

2
00:00:06,108 --> 00:00:12,180
I watched in absolute terror as my dark silhouette raised an arm I had not lifted.

3
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:18,696
Panic seized my chest. I backed away from the overhead light, needing distance from the floor.

4
00:00:18,996 --> 00:00:26,172
The shadow detached itself from the baseboard, sliding smoothly across the room toward the dark hallway.

5
00:00:26,472 --> 00:00:33,792
I followed it because stopping felt even more dangerous than walking into the unknown darkness.

6
00:00:34,092 --> 00:00:40,068
It stopped by the front door, waiting patiently with its hand curled around the brass handle.

7
00:00:40,368 --> 00:00:47,928
When the shadow twisted the lock, my own fingers suddenly snapped to imitate the exact motion.

8
00:00:48,228 --> 00:00:56,052
The heavy front door swung open wide, letting blinding daylight flood into the gloomy apartment.

9
00:00:56,352 --> 00:01:02,088
I stepped outside into the street, only to realize the sun was behind me the whole time.

10
00:01:02,388 --> 00:01:07,644
If the sun is at my back, why is my shadow standing right in front of me?
